  "description": "Read, write, validate and convert GDSII, OASIS and DXF layout files. Full record coverage, byte-exact round trip, hierarchy flattening with transforms, boolean operations, design rule checking against a deck you supply, SVG and PNG rendering and an ASCII record dump that reads back. Builds layouts too: rectangles, circles, ellipses, polygons and rings, Bezier curves, and routes with radiused bends and widths that taper along them - all as undoable edits - and typed tools an AI model can call to draw, edit and check a layout. No dependencies.",
